# Build context hygiene for services/api/Dockerfile (context is the repo root).
# No .env ever enters an image — the API reads configuration from the
# environment only, and secrets must not be layered into the build.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
web/dist
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
